
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Learners Club | Learn Digital Skills</title>
<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{margin:0;background:#08110e;color:#f3fff7;font-family:Arial,sans-serif}
header{padding:22px 6%;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;border-bottom:1px solid #20352a}
.logo{font-size:22px;font-weight:bold;color:#5df2a0}
nav a{color:#e6f7ed;text-decoration:none;margin-left:16px}
.hero{padding:65px 6%;background:linear-gradient(130deg,#102b20,#08110e)}
.hero small{color:#5df2a0}
h1{font-size:clamp(34px,7vw,60px);margin:16px 0}
.hero p{color:#b6c9bd;line-height:1.7;max-width:480px}
.btn{display:inline-block;background:#5df2a0;color:#07130d;padding:13px 20px;border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:bold;border:0;cursor:pointer}
section{padding:35px 6%}
h2{margin-bottom:8px}
.muted{color:#9eb3a5;line-height:1.6}
.courses{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(220px,1fr));gap:18px;margin-top:24px}
.card{background:#101e17;border:1px solid #294233;border-radius:14px;padding:22px}
.tag{color:#5df2a0;font-size:13px}
.card p{color:#b6c9bd;line-height:1.6}
.price{font-size:23px;font-weight:bold;margin:18px 0}
button:hover,.btn:hover{opacity:.85}
footer{padding:28px 6%;border-top:1px solid #20352a;color:#9eb3a5}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header>
  <div class="logo">Learners Club 📚</div>
  <nav><a href="#courses">Courses</a></nav>
</header>

<div class="hero">
  <small>YOUR FUTURE STARTS HERE</small>
  <h1>Learn skills.<br>Build your future.</h1>
  <p>Learn artificial intelligence, coding, programming and digital skills with beginner-friendly written lessons.</p>
  <a class="btn" href="#courses">Explore courses →</a>
</div>

<section id="courses">
  <h2>Explore our courses</h2>
  <p class="muted">Practical skills. Simple lessons. Learn at your own pace.</p>
  <div class="courses">
    <article class="card">
      <div class="tag">ARTIFICIAL INTELLIGENCE</div>
      <h3>AI for Beginners</h3>
      <p>Discover AI tools, learn prompt writing and explore ways to use AI in everyday projects.</p>
      <div class="price">₦2,000</div>
      <button class="btn" onclick="enroll('AI for Beginners',2000)">View course</button>
    </article>
    <article class="card">
      <div class="tag">WEB DEVELOPMENT</div>
      <h3>HTML & CSS Basics</h3>
      <p>Learn how websites are structured and styled, then create your first webpage.</p>
      <div class="price">₦2,500</div>
      <button class="btn" onclick="enroll('HTML & CSS Basics',2500)">View course</button>
    </article>
    <article class="card">
      <div class="tag">PROGRAMMING</div>
      <h3>JavaScript Basics</h3>
      <p>Understand variables, functions and the fundamentals of interactive websites.</p>
      <div class="price">₦3,000</div>
      <button class="btn" onclick="enroll('JavaScript Basics',3000)">View course</button>
    </article>
    <article class="card">
      <div class="tag">DIGITAL CREATION</div>
      <h3>AI Content Creation</h3>
      <p>Learn how to plan content and use AI tools to develop creative projects.</p>
      <div class="price">₦2,000</div>
      <button class="btn" onclick="enroll('AI Content Creation',2000)">View course</button>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="enroll">
  <h2>Ready to start learning?</h2>
  <p class="muted">Choose a course above to enquire about enrolment and bank transfer.</p>
  <p id="selected" class="muted">No course selected yet.</p>
  <p class="muted">Payment details will be provided after enrolment is set up.</p>
</section>

<footer>© 2026 Learners Club. Learn something new every day.</footer>

<script>
function enroll(course,price){
  document.getElementById('selected').textContent =
    course+' — ₦'+price.toLocaleString('en-NG')+
    '. Enrolment and payment setup coming soon.';
  document.getElementById('enroll').scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth'});
}
</script>
</body>
</html>
